  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "FinalIK is whitelisted for SDK3 worlds, but Udon cannot modify anything on these scripts. Checking the example scenes within FinalIK, the helper methods used to set values in the FinalIK scripts are not within the whitelist. \nWithout those helper scripts or methods exposed in Udon, FinalIk can only be used as is and cannot be changed during runtime.",
